{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://heartsandbonesrescue.org/register-to-adopt","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Retriever","breed_primary":"Retriever","description_text":"Meet Cassie, a sweet 10-month-old retreiver mix weighing 30 pounds. With her oversized ears and coat pattern that gives her the perpetual appearance of wearing an off-the-shoulder top, this little lady is as cute as they come. Cassie is described by her fosters as the quintessential family dog. She has been a great sibling to her human foster sister and is sweet as can be with her foster pawrents. She walks well on a leash and has taken to her crate like a champ. Cassie is working on being a confident pup when meeting new people, but always maintains her sweet nature. If you're looking for a gentle, playful and curious companion, Cassie is the perfect puppy pal for you!\n\nRegistered adopters interested in Cassie can email adopt@hbrdogs.com for more info. If you're not Registered yet, do it today at hbrdogs.com.","detail_url":"https://new.shelterluv.com/embed/animal/HBR-A-123543","id":"dc7179d0c33f28eb104e9127d944f18c","image_urls":["https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/116a308e9f9a97a8999c2514e097251f/dec4a1dc6807b48960b283d2c36dcb7a.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/512aa39417db3822952f7e31d22f2e60/9fc885690b95f5085b240728f53759ce.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/4c040aa90eabaa587076589970ba27c2/635e732b1c92113c83dd1d43151592f0.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/aca732d32dbdb811902f972d0a91c4b4/4f5748d693d6baef2455a6d2b892a34c.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/4db1b162716d4d414874b4b156879c92/941ebbe78ea781d050682303b3cbfbc6.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/ea94fa463d3daa446da85350f8cfe973/1ebb85becab304f93675a69c9fc84aae.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/c17c2094920ddfc2be202a160f5398bb/d5aced5435bd9e070d4bb1aabeaa215c.jpg","https://ne